ADDITIONAL NOTICE — ORIGINAL AUTHORSHIP

The phase space diffusion methodology, Hamiltonian encoding framework, and symplectic integration approach contained in this repository constitute original independent research by Catherine Earl, developed from first principles between 2023 and 2026.

This methodology derives in part from prior research in quantum hybrid inference conducted under OmniHenos Ltd (2023–present). The transfer of Hamiltonian phase space methods from quantum hybrid inference to classical robotics trajectory planning is an original contribution of this work.

Timestamped authorship is established via GitHub commit history (github.com/RubyCloud225/HNMG), technical documentation dated May 2026, and prior art in quantum hybrid inference (OmniHenos Ltd, 2023–present).

